 font-weight:700; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.06; letter-spacing:-0.03em; margin:0 0 18px; text-wrap:balance;">RFID tire tags for embedded automotive identification</h1><p style="font-size:16px; color:var(--ink-2); line-height:1.65; margin:0; text-wrap:pretty;">Hana manufactures antenna-chip assemblies and encapsulated RFID tire tags for embedding during tire production. Materials and assembly processes are selected for exposure to cure temperature, repeated flex and long-term road conditions.</p></div><div style="position:relative; overflow:hidden; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid var(--line); height:300px; background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,transparent 0 13px,rgba(18,131,221,0.06) 13px 14px);"><img src="/images/photos/mk-rfid-tire-warehouse.webp" alt="RFID tire tags in warehouse logistics" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div></div></div><div style="position:relative; z-index:1; padding:10px 48px; max-width:976px;"><div class="auto-spec"><div class="cell"><div class="l">Form factor</div><div class="v long">Embeddable</div></div><div class="cell"><div class="l">Cure-survive</div><div class="v long">High-temp rated</div></div><div class="cell"><div class="l">Compliant</div><div class="v long">ISO 18000-63</div></div><div class="cell"><div class="l">Tested</div><div class="v long">Long-life</div></div></div></div><div style="position:relative; z-index:1; padding:20px 48px; max-width:976px;"><div class="auto-sechead"><h2>The capability behind rfid tire tags</h2><p>Automotive tire-tag programs use Hana's RFID inlay, antenna attachment and encapsulation capabilities with materials and processes qualified for the tire environment.</p></div><div style="border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius-card); background:#fff; padding:28px 30px;"><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:21px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:-0.01em; margin:0 0 12px;">Built on Hana's RFID &amp; Smart Tag capability</h3><p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--ink-2); line-height:1.65; margin:0 0 20px; max-width:560px;">RFID tire-tag assembly draws on the same inlay, antenna attachment and encapsulation processes used across Hana's RFID manufacturing operations, with qualification extended to automotive tire requirements.</p><a href="/capabilities/rfid-smart-tags" style="font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--hana-blue); text-decoration:none; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;">See RFID &amp; Smart Tags <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div><div style="background:#071f35; border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:40px 0;"><div style="max-width:976px; padding:0 48px;"><div class="auto-sechead on-dark"><h2>Where it&#39;s made</h2><p>RFID tire-tag production is supported in Thailand and the USA on qualified RFID assembly lines.</p></div><div class="auto-plants" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);"><a class="auto-plantcard" href="/locations/lamphun" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;"><div><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Thailand</span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div></div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="auto-plantcard" href="/locations/ohio" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;"><div><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> USA</span><div class="nm">Ohio</div></div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="font-size:13px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); line-height:1.5; margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75); text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;">View all locations &rarr;</a></p></div></div><div style="background:var(--bg); border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:40px 0 48px;"><div style="max-width:976px; padding:0 48px;"><div class="auto-sechead"><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div class="auto-faq"><div class="item is-open"><button type="button" class="q"><span class="num">01</span><h3 class="qt">What makes a tire tag different from a standard RFID label?</h3><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-down" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i></span></button><div class="panel"><span></span><p>A tire tag is embedded in rubber during vulcanization and must therefore withstand cure temperatures above 150&deg;C, followed by repeated flex and temperature exposure throughout the tire's service life. The antenna, chip attachment and encapsulation materials are selected for this environment.</p></div></div><div class="item "><button type="button" class="q"><span class="num">02</span><h3 class="qt">What frequency and protocol does Hana produce for?</h3><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-down" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i></span></button><div class="panel"><span></span><p>Hana supports UHF operation across 860–960 MHz to ISO 18000-63 / EPC Gen 2. Other protocols can be considered to program requirements.</p></div></div><div class="item "><button type="button" class="q"><span class="num">03</span><h3 class="qt">Can Hana support the antenna design as well as production?</h3><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-down" style="width:16px;height:16px;"></i></span></button><div class="panel"><span></span><p>Yes. Hana can work with the customer on antenna geometry and encapsulation material selection so the tag can be qualified against the required tire compound, geometry and production process before volume manufacturing.</p></div></div></div><div style="margin-top:22px; padding-top:18px; border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/automotive" style="font-size:12px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.07em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--hana-blue); text-decoration:none; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;"><i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Automotive market hub</a></div></div></div></main></div><section class="auto-cta" style="background:var(--hana-blue-deep);" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-accent="cyan" data-fade="none"><div class="inner"><div><h2>Have a tire-tag program in mind?</h2><p>Send the tire compound and target volumes. We'll come back with a material and antenna approach and an indicative plan.</p></div><div class="actions"><a href="/contact" class="auto-btn auto-btn--ondark-primary">Start a program <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div>

